,{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each in ","type":"text"},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" order (by vertex index). The order is by the cliques’ first vertex in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"coreNumbers().degeneracyOrdering","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", then depth first, each clique followed by its extensions by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"later vertices in ascending index. The sequence holds the graph, so iterating again gives the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d) bitset words per clique for degeneracy d."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Cliques\/documentation\/Cliques\/AllCliques","title":"AllCliques"}}}